      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree, and in the latest patch in the video, I saw the new launch with the Live Now button. I don't mind the Live Now but the Social button is pushed down, and the calibrate button seems to be gone from there. Why is the shop button there instead of at the top of the launchpad?, Also, the select button I never touch it ever even in desktop mode, because you can hold shift to select (I do understand that some people may not know, so it is fine, but still). Making it customaizable would be a great feature.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
