  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-10-14T21:41:21.476Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The positioning of the \"Shop\" button on the \"Launch Pad\" is very poor. Please do not make the Social, \"Avatars,\" or \"World\" buttons smaller. I understand the importance of profitability, but if usability is taken into consideration, those buttons should probably be located in the bottom right corner. Alternatively, the banner at the top of the menu should be used appropriately.\n\nThe text for \"Quick Actions\" and \"Quick Links\" probably does not contribute much to visibility, so I think it would be better to remove it and reorder the buttons by narrowing the gap a bit. Buttons that some users do not use often, such as \"Select Use\" and \"Change Shield Level,\" are large, so it would be even better if they could be freely reordered.",
